/target
/captures
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/backend.hcl
terraform/artifacts/
terraform/*.tfplan
terraform/*.tfvars
# EXCEPT production.tfvars — non-secret prod CONFIG lives in source where it's diffable and
# reviewable (#88, lilith+ombb). Secrets (admin_password_hash, discord_webhook_url) never
# land here; they stay TF_VAR. A gitignored *.tfvars still blocks any OTHER accidental tfvars.
!terraform/production.tfvars
terraform-iam/.terraform/
terraform-iam/backend.hcl
terraform-iam/*.tfplan

# impeccable ephemeral state is ignored by .impeccable/.gitignore (live/sessions/,
# live/annotations/, live/server.json); design.json + live/config.json are tracked
# source (the design hook reads them). A root-level .impeccable/ rule here would be
# a no-op-vs-tracked-files contradiction (#80 finding 3).
